{"id":"00250","root":"uni00250_1","name":{"ja":"鬼崎　きらら","en":"Onisaki Kirara"},"title":{"ja":"【ハロウィンヴァンパイア】","en":"【Halloween Vampire】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ハロウィンヴァンパイア】 鬼崎　きらら","en":"【Halloween Vampire】 Onisaki Kirara"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Oni","Taimanin"],"release":"2019-10-15","limited":true,"characterId":150,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園の先輩。鬼族と人間のハーフで、霜の鬼神と呼ばれた高位鬼族の母から冷気を操る力を、対魔忍の父から忍法を受け継いだハイブリッド対魔忍。母親譲りの冷気の操る力は強力で、空気中の水分を凍結させて氷の盾を作ったり、冷気を纏った拳で敵を凍結させたりすることもできる。しかし父との確執から忍法の使用は封じており、彼女がどんな忍法を使うのか知る者はいなかった。鬼族の特徴である角が頭の横に生えているが、幼い時からのコンプレックスであるため、普段は大きなリボンともさもさのツインテールで隠している。基本的に男嫌いで、男は全員ケダモノだと思っている。鬼族の母はきららが幼い頃に、対魔忍である父の手によって殺された。それが父娘の確執、さらには男嫌いの原因となった。","en":"Onisaki Kirara is a senior at Gosha Academy. She is a hybrid Taimanin, born of a high-ranking ice demon mother and a ninja father. From her mother she inherited powerful ice manipulation, allowing her to freeze moisture in the air to form shields or encase her fists in frost to freeze enemies. Yet a rift with her father has sealed away her ninja techniques, leaving no one aware of what she might be capable of. Twin horns sprout from the sides of her head—a hallmark of her demon heritage—but she hides them beneath a large ribbon and a shaggy twin-tail, a long-standing complex from childhood. She harbors a deep dislike of men, viewing them all as beasts, a sentiment rooted in the fact that her mother was slain by her father's hand when she was young."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"白瀬ほなみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00250_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1248,2496],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[184,368],"def":[118,236],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","350004"]},{"id":"uni00250_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1896,3792],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[293,586],"def":[161,322],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","350004","350005"]},{"id":"uni00250_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","